### Time & Space Complexity

- Time complexity: $O(n + (k * \log n * \log s))$
- Space complexity: $O(n)$

> Where $n$ is the size of the array $nums$, $s$ is the sum of all the elements in the array, and $k$ is the number of sub-arrays to form.

